      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "先日、エリュートさんの花婿になり、\n彼女は準備を整えてくると言ったまま、\n数日間、何の連絡もなく僕は待たされていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "57788987acb11853d6cefe36fe7815421f3cfa2b4f1c28f54f4ab57b58b3fcd3",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あれから何もないけど、\nエリュートさんどうしたんだろう……わわっ！？",
      "jp_sha256": "3c4019d74ff314af0a28c5b69a5dbae14863e73dd7267afcd53353857dff2c21",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그 뒤로 아무 소식도 없는데,\n에류트 씨는 어떻게 된 거지…… 우왓!?",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
